11	 * {@code '<REGION>-<HASH8>'}.
12	 *
13	 * <p>REGION is the canonical region for the owner (see {@link CityRegion}, postcode-preferred with a
14	 * city-table fallback). HASH8 is the first 8 UPPER-case hex characters of the SHA-256 digest over
15	 * {@code normalizedTelephone + lastName} (e.g. {@code 'NSW-1A2B3C4D'}). There are no sequence numbers.
16	 *
17	 * <p>Kept as a standalone helper (rather than a method on {@link OwnerMapper}) so MapStruct does not
18	 * mistake it for a mapping method and apply it to unrelated fields.
19	 */
